        <mxCell id="core" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=9;fillColor=#E9F1FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;fontColor=#162C45;fontSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;strokeWidth=2.8;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:17px&quot;&gt;drive_core.sv  —  TOP FPGA&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748B&quot; style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;15 module SystemVerilog • 1 clock domain&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#334155&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;TV1 • Reset/CDC + Safety FSM • watchdog 50ms&lt;br/&gt;TV2 • UART RX/TX + CRC16 + command guard&lt;br/&gt;TV3 • PWM 20kHz + Encoder snapshot 10ms&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;IN → kiểm tra → xử lý đồng bộ → OUT&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Trang 2: giao diện giữa module&lt;br/&gt;Trang 3: cây phân cấp 15 module&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
